{"content_hash": "f13301edc22b09c2", "version_id": 945, "article_id": 95, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 tops Steam chart as Phantom Blade Zero trails close behind", "title_zh": "《使命召唤：现代战争4》登顶Steam周榜，《影之刃零》紧随其后", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222184", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1672545701317-5177e9f41166?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fHN0ZWFtfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ0NTAxODh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Paul Crook on Unsplash", "author": "Paul Crook", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@goldenplover31?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-black-train-traveling-down-train-tracks-next-to-a-lush-green-field-HIPH-vbN8Kg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(264, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(302, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "2e082aa759d3"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-12", "word_count": 277, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Valve has published its latest global Steam bestseller list for the first week of November 2026, with Activision's shooter taking the top spot and a Chinese action title close on its heels.", "lead_zh": "Valve公布了2026年11月第一周的Steam全球销量排行榜，动视的射击新作登顶，一款国产动作游戏紧随其后。", "preview": "Valve released its latest weekly Steam global bestseller ranking today, covering the first week of November 2026. As is customary, the chart", "preview_zh": "Valve今日公布了最新一期Steam全球销量排行榜，统计范围为2026年11月第一周。按照惯例，榜单不计入长期霸榜的免费游戏，以便为玩家选购游戏和硬件提供更清晰的参考。本周榜单既有熟悉的面孔领跑，也有一款国产动作游戏表现格外抢眼。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 929, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 122.3, "size_bytes": 734688, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 308, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@315af5f/content/data/versions/945.json", "paragraphs": ["Valve released its latest weekly Steam global bestseller ranking today, covering the first week of November 2026. As is customary, the chart excludes free-to-play mainstays so that it offers a cleaner guide to what players are actually buying, whether games or hardware. This week's edition produced a familiar front-runner alongside a notably strong showing from a Chinese-developed action title.", "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 seized first place, consolidating the franchise's perennial grip on the platform's paid charts. Directly behind it came Phantom Blade Zero, the eagerly anticipated action game from Chinese studio S-Game, whose runner-up finish suggests that pre-release momentum has translated into substantial commercial traction well ahead of launch.", "Third place went to AION 2, the long-gestating sequel to the Korean MMORPG, while Football Manager 27 and the idiosyncratically titled Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen rounded out the top five. EA SPORTS FC 27, the original Call of Duty, Final Fantasy XIV and Moon Sweepers occupied positions seven through nine, with Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered closing out the top ten.", "The composition of the list is instructive: established live-service giants such as Final Fantasy XIV continue to sell steadily, yet they are increasingly flanked by remasters and revivals of older properties, a sign that nostalgia remains a commercially potent force. Valve's decision to strip free-to-play titles from the ranking likewise sharpens the picture, foregrounding premium releases over the perpetual earners that otherwise dominate.", "Elsewhere on the platform, Valve confirmed that Steam account integration will proceed as normal, and it was announced that the online edition of Gujian Online will stop receiving updates on 29 January 2026, though its servers will continue to operate."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Valve今日公布了最新一期Steam全球销量排行榜，统计范围为2026年11月第一周。按照惯例，榜单不计入长期霸榜的免费游戏，以便为玩家选购游戏和硬件提供更清晰的参考。本周榜单既有熟悉的面孔领跑，也有一款国产动作游戏表现格外抢眼。", "《使命召唤：现代战争4》拿下第一，进一步巩固了该系列在平台付费榜上的常胜地位。紧随其后的是中国工作室S-Game备受期待的动作游戏《影之刃零》，其亚军成绩说明发售前的热度已经转化为相当可观的商业表现。", "第三名是酝酿已久的韩国MMORPG续作《AION 2》，第四、第五分别是《足球经理27》和名字颇为另类的《深空当铺：可能是偷的》。《EA SPORTS FC 27》、初代《使命召唤》、《最终幻想14》和《Moon Sweepers》占据第七至第九位，第十名则是《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》。", "榜单的构成颇能说明问题：《最终幻想14》这类成熟的长期运营游戏销量依旧稳定，但身边越来越多地出现老作品的复刻与重制，可见怀旧情怀仍是一股强劲的吸金力量。Valve将免费游戏排除在榜单之外，也让画面更清晰，把付费新作推到台前，而非那些常年霸榜的常青树。", "平台其他方面，Valve确认Steam账户整合将照常进行；同时有消息称，《古剑奇谭网络版》将于2026年1月29日停止更新，但服务器仍将继续运行。"], "body": "Valve released its latest weekly Steam global bestseller ranking today, covering the first week of November 2026. As is customary, the chart excludes free-to-play mainstays so that it offers a cleaner guide to what players are actually buying, whether games or hardware. This week's edition produced a familiar front-runner alongside a notably strong showing from a Chinese-developed action title.\n\nCall of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 seized first place, consolidating the franchise's perennial grip on the platform's paid charts. Directly behind it came Phantom Blade Zero, the eagerly anticipated action game from Chinese studio S-Game, whose runner-up finish suggests that pre-release momentum has translated into substantial commercial traction well ahead of launch.\n\nThird place went to AION 2, the long-gestating sequel to the Korean MMORPG, while Football Manager 27 and the idiosyncratically titled Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen rounded out the top five. EA SPORTS FC 27, the original Call of Duty, Final Fantasy XIV and Moon Sweepers occupied positions seven through nine, with Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered closing out the top ten.\n\nThe composition of the list is instructive: established live-service giants such as Final Fantasy XIV continue to sell steadily, yet they are increasingly flanked by remasters and revivals of older properties, a sign that nostalgia remains a commercially potent force. Valve's decision to strip free-to-play titles from the ranking likewise sharpens the picture, foregrounding premium releases over the perpetual earners that otherwise dominate.\n\nElsewhere on the platform, Valve confirmed that Steam account integration will proceed as normal, and it was announced that the online edition of Gujian Online will stop receiving updates on 29 January 2026, though its servers will continue to operate.", "body_zh": "Valve今日公布了最新一期Steam全球销量排行榜，统计范围为2026年11月第一周。按照惯例，榜单不计入长期霸榜的免费游戏，以便为玩家选购游戏和硬件提供更清晰的参考。本周榜单既有熟悉的面孔领跑，也有一款国产动作游戏表现格外抢眼。\n\n《使命召唤：现代战争4》拿下第一，进一步巩固了该系列在平台付费榜上的常胜地位。紧随其后的是中国工作室S-Game备受期待的动作游戏《影之刃零》，其亚军成绩说明发售前的热度已经转化为相当可观的商业表现。\n\n第三名是酝酿已久的韩国MMORPG续作《AION 2》，第四、第五分别是《足球经理27》和名字颇为另类的《深空当铺：可能是偷的》。《EA SPORTS FC 27》、初代《使命召唤》、《最终幻想14》和《Moon Sweepers》占据第七至第九位，第十名则是《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》。\n\n榜单的构成颇能说明问题：《最终幻想14》这类成熟的长期运营游戏销量依旧稳定，但身边越来越多地出现老作品的复刻与重制，可见怀旧情怀仍是一股强劲的吸金力量。Valve将免费游戏排除在榜单之外，也让画面更清晰，把付费新作推到台前，而非那些常年霸榜的常青树。\n\n平台其他方面，Valve确认Steam账户整合将照常进行；同时有消息称，《古剑奇谭网络版》将于2026年1月29日停止更新，但服务器仍将继续运行。", "text": "Valve released its latest weekly Steam global bestseller ranking today, covering the first week of November 2026. As is customary, the chart excludes free-to-play mainstays so that it offers a cleaner guide to what players are actually buying, whether games or hardware. This week's edition produced a familiar front-runner alongside a notably strong showing from a Chinese-developed action title. Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 seized first place, consolidating the franchise's perennial grip on the platform's paid charts. Directly behind it came Phantom Blade Zero, the eagerly anticipated action game from Chinese studio S-Game, whose runner-up finish suggests that pre-release momentum has translated into substantial commercial traction well ahead of launch. Third place went to AION 2, the long-gestating sequel to the Korean MMORPG, while Football Manager 27 and the idiosyncratically titled Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen rounded out the top five. EA SPORTS FC 27, the original Call of Duty, Final Fantasy XIV and Moon Sweepers occupied positions seven through nine, with Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered closing out the top ten. The composition of the list is instructive: established live-service giants such as Final Fantasy XIV continue to sell steadily, yet they are increasingly flanked by remasters and revivals of older properties, a sign that nostalgia remains a commercially potent force. Valve's decision to strip free-to-play titles from the ranking likewise sharpens the picture, foregrounding premium releases over the perpetual earners that otherwise dominate. Elsewhere on the platform, Valve confirmed that Steam account integration will proceed as normal, and it was announced that the online edition of Gujian Online will stop receiving updates on 29 January 2026, though its servers will continue to operate.", "vocab": [{"word": "bestseller ranking", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "销量排行榜", "note": "商业榜单常用表达", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "customary", "pos": "adj", "zh": "惯常的，按惯例的", "note": "as is customary 常用于说明惯例", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mainstay", "pos": "noun", "zh": "支柱，常青事物", "note": "常指长期占据榜单的作品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "front-runner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "领跑者", "note": "竞争语境中的领先者", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "seize first place", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "夺得第一", "note": "比 take first place 更有力度", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "consolidate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "巩固", "note": "consolidate one's grip 巩固掌控", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "perennial", "pos": "adj", "zh": "长期不变的，常年的", "note": "perennial grip 常年的统治力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "eagerly anticipated", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "备受期待的", "note": "形容未发作品的高关注度", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "traction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "势头，市场认可", "note": "gain traction 获得势头", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "long-gestating", "pos": "adj", "zh": "酝酿已久的", "note": "形容开发周期长的项目", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "idiosyncratically", "pos": "adv", "zh": "别具一格地，古怪地", "note": "略带调侃意味", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "round out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "补足，凑成完整的一组", "note": "round out the top five 凑齐前五", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "instructive", "pos": "adj", "zh": "有启发性的", "note": "常用于分析性评论", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "foreground", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使突出，把……推到前面", "note": "作动词时意为强调、凸显", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-12T02:23:06.579859", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Valve", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.675, "sm": 325, "em": 675, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "released", "s": 0.675, "e": 1.15, "sm": 675, "em": 1149, "cs": 6, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "its", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.362, "sm": 1150, "em": 1362, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "latest", "s": 1.363, "e": 1.812, "sm": 1362, "em": 1812, "cs": 19, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "weekly", "s": 1.812, "e": 2.263, "sm": 1812, "em": 2262, "cs": 26, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Steam", "s": 2.263, "e": 2.625, "sm": 2262, "em": 2624, "cs": 33, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "global", "s": 2.625, "e": 3.0, "sm": 2625, "em": 3000, "cs": 39, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "bestseller", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.55, "sm": 3000, "em": 3549, "cs": 46, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "ranking", "s": 3.55, "e": 3.925, "sm": 3550, "em": 3925, "cs": 57, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "today", "s": 3.925, "e": 4.525, "sm": 3925, "em": 4524, "cs": 65, "ce": 70, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": ",", "s": 4.525, "e": 4.65, "sm": 4525, "em": 4650, "cs": 70, "ce": 71, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "covering", "s": 4.65, "e": 4.987, "sm": 4650, "em": 4987, "cs": 72, "ce": 80, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "the", "s": 4.987, "e": 5.087, "sm": 4987, "em": 5087, "cs": 81, "ce": 84, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w"